{"4478200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "這遺虚配信", "steam_appid": 4478200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abandoned Exploration × Live Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the Kirigafuchi Hotel!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ To the Hotel ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a content creator and live streamer.<br>While sorting through your late grandmother’s belongings, you discover a certain letter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was addressed to the founder of a place called the “Kirigafuchi Hotel.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“The people who died in that accident are still bound to that place.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawn by those ominous words, you decide to head to the Kirigafuchi Hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/090e68f8e65a287219bceccff7b138b3.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/090e68f8e65a287219bceccff7b138b3.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=771 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ The Camera and the Monsters ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ーーーWho created this camera… and why?ーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the hotel, you obtain a mysterious camera—<br>a strange device capable of defeating monsters that appear only in this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the camera’s  power to defeat as many of the creatures haunting the hotel as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ending changes based on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth lies behind the monsters, the hotel, and the mysterious camera...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/ff6219a6793d6786524c37649bc30701.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/ff6219a6793d6786524c37649bc30701.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=677 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Investigate with the Help of Viewer Comments ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, comments from your viewers will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some comments provide useful gameplay tips,<br>while others hold important clues to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to read them carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/2b118ba3669cc765f9b615982b6a4662.avif?t=1773711703\" width=1560 height=871 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Use Super Chats to Gain the Upper Hand ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase items using the Super Chats you receive from viewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items will unlock as you progress through the exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them wisely to survive and continue safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Return Home Before It’s Too Late ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to leave the hotel is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if you stay too long into the night, enemies will begin attacking in groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/0783cf7baa808c75c9d98d0e6d897d8f.avif?t=1773711703\" width=1560 height=881 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Game Features ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• High-quality graphics powered by Unity HDRP<br>• Three different endings<br>• Experience the thrill of being a live streamer<br>• Light horror elements — recommended even for players who are not good with horror<br>(You can avoid nighttime exploration if you return home early… if you can.)<br>• Simple controls (Move + Right Click to ready your camera)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/c46f819741b25a5340061387e4413b4e.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/c46f819741b25a5340061387e4413b4e.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=702 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Recommended For ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Players who enjoy mystery and puzzle-solving<br>• Players who like defeating enemies<br>• Players who love exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/ccb36a7d0d0e5dcbb46b132531799e8b.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/ccb36a7d0d0e5dcbb46b132531799e8b.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=715 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abandoned Exploration × Live Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the Kirigafuchi Hotel!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ To the Hotel ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a content creator and live streamer.<br>While sorting through your late grandmother’s belongings, you discover a certain letter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was addressed to the founder of a place called the “Kirigafuchi Hotel.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“The people who died in that accident are still bound to that place.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawn by those ominous words, you decide to head to the Kirigafuchi Hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/090e68f8e65a287219bceccff7b138b3.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/090e68f8e65a287219bceccff7b138b3.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=771 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ The Camera and the Monsters ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ーーーWho created this camera… and why?ーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the hotel, you obtain a mysterious camera—<br>a strange device capable of defeating monsters that appear only in this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the camera’s  power to defeat as many of the creatures haunting the hotel as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ending changes based on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth lies behind the monsters, the hotel, and the mysterious camera...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/ff6219a6793d6786524c37649bc30701.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/ff6219a6793d6786524c37649bc30701.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=677 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Investigate with the Help of Viewer Comments ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, comments from your viewers will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some comments provide useful gameplay tips,<br>while others hold important clues to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to read them carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/2b118ba3669cc765f9b615982b6a4662.avif?t=1773711703\" width=1560 height=871 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Use Super Chats to Gain the Upper Hand ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase items using the Super Chats you receive from viewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items will unlock as you progress through the exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them wisely to survive and continue safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Return Home Before It’s Too Late ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to leave the hotel is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if you stay too long into the night, enemies will begin attacking in groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/0783cf7baa808c75c9d98d0e6d897d8f.avif?t=1773711703\" width=1560 height=881 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Game Features ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• High-quality graphics powered by Unity HDRP<br>• Three different endings<br>• Experience the thrill of being a live streamer<br>• Light horror elements — recommended even for players who are not good with horror<br>(You can avoid nighttime exploration if you return home early… if you can.)<br>• Simple controls (Move + Right Click to ready your camera)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/c46f819741b25a5340061387e4413b4e.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/c46f819741b25a5340061387e4413b4e.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=702 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■ Recommended For ■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Players who enjoy mystery and puzzle-solving<br>• Players who like defeating enemies<br>• Players who love exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras/ccb36a7d0d0e5dcbb46b132531799e8b.avif?t=1773711703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/extras_big/ccb36a7d0d0e5dcbb46b132531799e8b.webp?t=1773711703 width=1560 height=715 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Photograph and repel the monsters that appear in the abandoned hotel using a mysterious camera! Uncover the mysteries surrounding the abandoned hotel by relying on comments from your viewers! Use the Super Chats you receive to buy items and gain the upper hand in battle!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/c9fadff3a039fe9317e2e795fa7f286bdeb81d5c/header.jpg?t=1773711703", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/93a8e44a0c8d20f79331b95e7c5e0baf9894545f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773711703", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478200/93a8e44a0c8d20f79331b95e7c5e0baf9894545f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773711703", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-9600K / Ryzen 5 3600 以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB / RX 580</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> - GPU：RTX 2060 / RX 5600 XT 以上</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas